WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.300
The real window, with a stand-in engine and example models: the figures are placeholders.

2
00:00:05.900 --> 00:00:22.900
Open Resources and scroll to the speed tools.

3
00:00:23.300 --> 00:00:27.900
Record the expert routing, find the best settings, and test the drive.

4
00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:34.400
A recording starts the next time the model starts. It is analysed on your computer.

5
00:00:34.800 --> 00:00:37.900
Cancel it for now. Next: auto-tune.

6
00:00:38.300 --> 00:00:46.400
Auto-tune restarts the model several times. A warning comes first, and you can cancel.

